              <i data-lucide="git-pull-request" style="width: 36px; height: 36px; color: var(--text-muted);"></i>
              <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); margin: 0;">Welcome to pull requests!</h3>
              <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 480px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
                Pull requests help you collaborate on code with other people. As pull requests are created, they'll appear here in a searchable and filterable list. To get started, you should <span style="color: var(--accent-blue); cursor: pointer; text-decoration: underline;" id="create-first-pr-link">create a pull request</span>.
